  randomFlavorTexts:
  - The bears get back on their hind legs and bring their claws down.
  - The bears rapidly swing their claws at Natsuki. Again.
  - The bears coordinate their swings once more. Scoundrels...
  - The bears start shedding again. (They should consider a barber.)
  - The angry swarm of bees charge back into battle. Those punks!
  - The angry bees come toward Natsuki's side. Those stinkers!
  - The beehives descend once more. Mortifying!
  - The bears pick up fallen beehives, throwing them at Natsuki once more.
  - One of the bears pulls out a bow and starts shooting multiple arrows at once.
    (???)
  - One of the bears whips out a greataxe, swinging it at Natsuki. (?!?)
  maxHealth: 150
